          "title": "隐形眼镜计算机",
          "content": "<p>一家美国创业公司推出了，世界第一台集成在隐形眼镜上的计算机。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202207/bg2022070105.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202207/bg2022070106.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>这个隐形眼镜厚度不足0.5毫米，但是上面集成了 ARM Core M0 处理器、信号接收器、微型电池。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202207/bg2022070107.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202207/bg2022070108.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>它能在视野中，显示单色图形，还能让用户通过眼球运动来控制。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202207/bg2022070109.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
